{"id":"torrey:self-righteousness","source":"torrey","name":"Self-Righteousness","slug":"self-righteousness","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Man is prone to — Pr 20:6; 30:12.","refs":[["Prov",20,6,20,6],["Prov",30,12,30,12]]},{"text":"Hateful to God — Lu 16:15.","refs":[["Luke",16,15,16,15]]},{"text":"But external. — Mt 23:25-28; Lu 11:39-44.","refs":[["Matt",23,25,23,28],["Luke",11,39,11,44]]},{"text":"But partial. — Mt 23:25; Lu 11:44.","refs":[["Matt",23,25,23,25],["Luke",11,44,11,44]]},{"text":"No better than filthy rags. — Isa 64:6.","refs":[["Isa",64,6,64,6]]},{"text":"Ineffectual for salvation. — Job 9:30,31; Mt 5:20; Ro 3:20.","refs":[["Job",9,30,9,30],["Job",9,31,9,31],["Matt",5,20,5,20],["Rom",3,20,3,20]]},{"text":"Unprofitable. — Isa 57:12.","refs":[["Isa",57,12,57,12]]},{"text":"Is boastful — Mt 23:30.","refs":[["Matt",23,30,23,30]]},{"text":"Audaciously approach God. — Lu 18:11.","refs":[["Luke",18,11,18,11]]},{"text":"Seek to justify themselves. — Lu 10:29.","refs":[["Luke",10,29,10,29]]},{"text":"Seek to justify themselves before men. — Lu 16:15.","refs":[["Luke",16,15,16,15]]},{"text":"Reject the righteousness of God. — Ro 10:3.","refs":[["Rom",10,3,10,3]]},{"text":"Condemn others. — Mt 9:11-13; Lu 7:39.","refs":[["Matt",9,11,9,13],["Luke",7,39,7,39]]},{"text":"Consider their own way right. — Pr 21:2.","refs":[["Prov",21,2,21,2]]},{"text":"Despise others. — Isa 65:5; Lu 18:9.","refs":[["Isa",65,5,65,5],["Luke",18,9,18,9]]},{"text":"Proclaim their own goodness. — Pr 20:6.","refs":[["Prov",20,6,20,6]]},{"text":"Are pure in their own eyes. — Pr 30:12.","refs":[["Prov",30,12,30,12]]},{"text":"Are abominable before God. — Isa 65:5.","refs":[["Isa",65,5,65,5]]},{"text":"Folly of — Job 9:20.","refs":[["Job",9,20,9,20]]},{"text":"Saints renounce — Php 3:7-10.","refs":[["Phil",3,7,3,10]]},{"text":"Warning against — De 9:4.","refs":[["Deut",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Denunciation against — Mt 23:27,28.","refs":[["Matt",23,27,23,27],["Matt",23,28,23,28]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Lu 18:10-12.","refs":[["Luke",18,10,18,12]]},{"text":"Saul. — 1Sa 15:13.","refs":[["1Sam",15,13,15,13]]},{"text":"Young man. — Mt 19:20.","refs":[["Matt",19,20,19,20]]},{"text":"Lawyer. — Lu 10:25,29.","refs":[["Luke",10,25,10,25],["Luke",10,29,10,29]]},{"text":"Pharisees. — Lu 11:39; Joh 8:33; 9:28.","refs":[["Luke",11,39,11,39],["John",8,33,8,33],["John",9,28,9,28]]},{"text":"Israel. — Ro 10:3.","refs":[["Rom",10,3,10,3]]},{"text":"Church of Laodicea. — Re 3:17.","refs":[["Rev",3,17,3,17]]}],"refCount":41}
